  "design": "The first 4 ids of the frozen S list, in that file order. Clean answers are read back from the inject JSONL and are not requested again. Reorder reverses the record list and leaves every question's text unchanged. Paraphrase uses the single template stored in c_stress_ids.json: the clinical clause and the three label definitions stay verbatim, and only the instruction boilerplate around them changes. Scope-question wording is not paraphrased, because those questions have no clinical clause. Option order was not shuffled, so this pilot stays inside the 24-request GPT cap. Flip rates, decision derivation, and accuracy use the inject-arm rules.",
